      "text": "Factoring out a \\(2^{2012},\\) we get: \\[ \\dfrac{2^{2012}(2^2 + 1)}{2^{2012}(2^2 - 1)} = \\dfrac{5}{3}. \\]\n\nThus, C is the correct answer.",
